      <p source="#source-24-56"><seg source="#source-24-56">東京はタイクツな町だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-56-70"><seg source="#source-56-70">男も女も</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-70-84"><seg source="#source-70-84">笑わずに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-84-107"><seg source="#source-84-107">とがった神経で</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-107-127"><seg source="#source-107-127">高いカカトで</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-127-168"><seg source="#source-127-168">自分の目的の外は何も考えず</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-168-187"><seg source="#source-168-187">歩いて行く</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-187-210"><seg source="#source-187-210">東京は冷い町だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-210-245"><seg source="#source-210-245">レンガもアスファルトも</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-245-259"><seg source="#source-245-259">笑わずに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-259-276"><seg source="#source-259-276">四角い顔で</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-276-293"><seg source="#source-276-293">冷い表情で</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-293-316"><seg source="#source-293-316">ほこりまみれで</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-316-344"><seg source="#source-316-344">よこたわっている</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-344-358"><seg source="#source-344-358">東京では</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-358-381"><seg source="#source-358-381">漫画やオペラが</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-381-401"><seg source="#source-381-401">要るはずだと</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-401-416"><seg source="#source-401-416">うなずける</seg></p>
    </body>
